[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13502.95, "timestamp": "03:45:02", "text": "現実性という点では、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13504.71, "timestamp": "03:45:04", "text": "飛行機は失速する可能性があります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13511.99, "timestamp": "03:45:11", "text": "上。そして私は常にあなたより優位に立つことができる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13513.75, "timestamp": "03:45:13", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13523.189, "timestamp": "03:45:23", "text": "待って、君はどこにいるの？そうすれば私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13530.07, "timestamp": "03:45:30", "text": "何てことだ。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13530.395, "timestamp": "03:45:30", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "flying around at the speed of sound"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13533.67, "timestamp": "03:45:33", "text": "君はまさに私の飛行機を左に壊したんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13535.269, "timestamp": "03:45:35", "text": "さっき言った通り、私はあなたより上にいられるわ。私"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13536.773, "timestamp": "03:45:36", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "rip no wing"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13538.309, "timestamp": "03:45:38", "text": "君より上だった。あなたは上を指差していましたね。おお"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13546.07, "timestamp": "03:45:46", "text": "神。ああ、私が作ろうか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13549.11, "timestamp": "03:45:49", "text": "新しい飛行機に乗り換える方が早いですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13551.91, "timestamp": "03:45:51", "text": "ああ、そうだった。ああ、それは君のことだよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13555.03, "timestamp": "03:45:55", "text": "私を殺したい。ああ、わかりました。いいえ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13556.95, "timestamp": "03:45:56", "text": "つまり、あなたはそれを操縦できますか、それともただ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13558.63, "timestamp": "03:45:58", "text": "ゆっくりと地面に墜落するのだろうか？いいえ、"}]